            "review_title": "Review at Âu Lạc Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Artemis G\n6 contributions\n0\nDinner\nAug 2025 • Solo\nA brand new restaurant that just opened over a month ago.\nThe staff is extremely attentive, the kitchen delivers good fresh Vietnamese dishes for a short wait, from a carefully arranged menu that, despite being short, leaves you spoiled for choice.\nThe owner is passionate and has great attention for detail.\nYou can expect a light atmosphere and tasteful decor inside. It's a little off the beaten track so definitely one of those places that not everyone knows about yet!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 3, 2025",
